    {"text": "Do you pull it?", "gap": 0.55},
    {"text": "Most people say yes. Five lives for one.", "gap": 0.55},
    {"text": "Now change one thing. No lever."},
    {"text": "You're on a bridge, next to a stranger."},
    {"text": "Push him onto the track, and his body stops the trolley.", "gap": 0.45},
    {"text": "Same math. Five for one."},
    {"text": "But now, most people say no.", "gap": 0.6},
    {"text": "So, was it ever about the numbers?"}
